uka, the girl who once lived in Kotori's room."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21753"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"コールダックという小さな種類のアヒル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"碧が来た時には、すでに寮に住みついていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰が飼ってるわけでもなくそこにいる謎のアヒル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は、イスカが招き入れたという過去がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小鳥に懐いていて、車椅子の膝に乗ったり、一緒にお風呂に入ったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰かが作ったお手製のシルクハットをかぶっているので “ハット” と呼ばれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"136383"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7fcc8438b51bd0094a725dc8330aefe30e1dbeafa4cfe563257b2df24497e81.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f30fd4eba251b5b6e5a1f03d2ad8d5421ec0b2a35ba0e75c978c5096c87bdf00.webp","width":256,"height":153,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田佳代","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:100415:136383:6038:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c9333","characterName":"羽々音 小鳥","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16051","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102681"},{"characterId":"16051","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16051","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["126"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9333"},"originalCharacterName":"羽々音 小鳥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful girl bound to a wheelchair. She is a slender girl with long, black hair and a tidy appearance but is strong-willed and speaks with confidence. Also, a crybaby. Because she transferred to Keifuu Academy for the simple reason that she is unable to move her legs and Keifuu Academy is completely barrier free, she has no interests in classes which teach specialty fields. Because of this, she is completely cut off from those around her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9333"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子寮の問題児な車椅子の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒髪ロングの華奢で清楚な外見だが、話す言葉は強情で強気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グライダー部では部長として、目標に向かって突き進む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"脚が怪我で動かせないという理由のみで、完全バリアフリーな恵風学園にやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、専門的な分野を教える授業に興味がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親から「寮に足の不自由な子がいるから、面倒みてあげて」と言われ、主人公は女子寮の一番の問題児である彼女に、なんだかんだと世話を焼くようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"126","sourceWorkId":"16506","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"轮椅美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有纤细的黑色长发、外表很清秀。但言语之中透露着坚强和倔强。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而且是一个爱掉眼泪的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为腿脚无法行动而来到对残疾人无障碍的恵風学園，但对专业领域的授课没有兴趣。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为此，特别显眼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公碧因为被母亲告知「寝室里有行动不便的学生，帮忙照顾一下」，所以对女生宿舍里最有困难的小鳥各方面都颇为照顾。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16051"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b066cb3fdcec9384db798f55575b3ca3d56a03b70051bbd3a97423e35dc16cbb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a712284808eee090afbc6430fd5de4d330bed0365ea36650d921e2e7b960fe3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"咲乃藍里","creatorId":"vndb:s436","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s436","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s436","name":"咲乃 藍里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:100415:16051:5692:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c9338","characterName":"水瀬 碧","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16067","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16067","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["131"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9338"},"originalCharacterName":"水瀬 碧","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aoi is a boy who has returned to his hometown of Kazegaura as a result of a cycling race accident. He had intended on returning to his parents’ home but was made the manager of Keifuu Academy’s girls’ dormitory by his mother who manages the dormitory. Through meeting Kotori, he begins getting back the passion he once had and pushes forward."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9338"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小时候住在風ヶ浦，因为双亲的关系搬家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这次回到了阔别数年的故乡。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然碧打算住在自己家，但被母亲强迫当了其所管理的女生宿舍的管理员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"碧家务万能，料理技术高超，并且一旦开始打扫便会沉迷其中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近因为某件事情稍显悲观失望，但自从和小鳥相遇并开始照顾她之后一点一点变得乐观了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原本他有着满腔热血、任何事情都灵活乐观应对的性格。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16067"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d3f51f1a5ebbfea327ac194394978281c08692e696cdd451a439e7b6d788fc8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0938806cfb02cdc2740acd6ed4aed38a650b45517e9e33fa4c